  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n(7)/(2)+(11)/(3)+(7)/(6)+(11)/(15)+(7)/(12)+(11)/(35)+ldots+(7)/(156)+(11)/(575)\n\n**Formula used:**\n\n(1)/(n(n+k)) = (1)/(k)((1)/(n) - (1)/(n+k))\n\n**Calculation:**\n\n(7)/(2)+(11)/(3)+(7)/(6)+(11)/(15)+dots+(7)/(156)+(11)/(575) = ?\n\n⇒ ((7)/(1 times 2) + (7)/(2 times 3) + dots + (7)/(12 times 13)) + ((11)/(1 times 3) + (11)/(3 times 5) + dots + (11)/(23 times 25))\n\n⇒ 7(1 - (1)/(13)) + (11)/(2)(1 - (1)/(25))\n\n⇒ 7 times (12)/(13) + (11)/(2) times (24)/(25)\n\n⇒ (84)/(13) + (132)/(25)\n\n⇒ (2100 + 1716)/(325)\n\n⇒ ? = (3816)/(325)\n\n**∴ The correct answer is option 2.**",
